WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.366
This query converts numeric quality scores into
broad bands and counts customers in each band

00:00:07.215 --> 00:00:12.862
A summary like this can help prioritize review But
the band does not

00:00:12.875 --> 00:00:18.638
replace the underlying dimensions If a row has a low
score you should still

00:00:18.651 --> 00:00:24.059
be able to explain whether the problem is
missingness invalid contact data timeliness or
something

00:00:24.085 --> 00:00:24.453
else
